# An @errors key that names no rule (a misspelling) is an error, not ignored.
# error: errors_unknown_rule.grammar:16:5:
# error: @errors names 'tpo', which is no rule
@lexer
tokens
    ident
    newline
    eof
    err
'\n'                                        → newline
[a-z]+                                      → ident
.                                           → err

@parser
@errors
    tpo: "a top"
top! = IDENT                                → (t 1)
